*/*-data/*
*/*-logs/*
*/.env
.env

# config/ is never gitignored. It holds .example templates and non-sensitive
# files only, and must never hold a real secret by convention.
#
# A real credential never lives in a checkout at all. It lives on the host,
# under ${DOCKER_VOLUMES}/${PROJECT_NAME}/<container>-secrets/, and the compose
# file bind-mounts it in. See each container's stack-README. This rule stays as
# a backstop in case one is ever written into a checkout by hand.
containers/*/secrets/

# Working notes, never meant to be tracked.
PLAN.md
